  "status": "Draft. First full A/B gates and every fixed A/A run failed. No performance clearance.",
  "notes": [
    "The files array lists the exact intended PR files except this manifest, which cannot hash itself.",
    "The generated array records build outputs. These generated binaries and JavaScript files are not part of the PR file set.",
    "Stage source and driver hashes were checked against both recorded runtime reports.",
    "Stage 3 source and all current diagnostic input bundles were checked against the fixed A/A cohort.",
    "Current report and README hashes include the diagnostic findings; the diagnostic controller hash records the fixed executable schedule used in that cohort.",
    "The PR added these 25 raw records. They moved into this experiment's results directory to satisfy strict preservation of the baseline proofs/results tree. Every raw file and historical driver retains its original bytes. Paths inside raw records remain historical provenance.",
    "The first hosted workflow status is invalid: tee hid producer failures under bash -e. The job shell now enables pipefail. A deliberate producer exit of 23 returns 23 under the exact fixed shell; the old default returns 0.",
    "The new million-value numeric test now uses a private Arena. This limits shared default-fixture state. It does not prove the cause of the separate hosted geometry timeout. The geometry test and test timeout were not changed. The old and repaired numeric test sources are retained."
  ],
